      "title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3b6d208ce7b42a15\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMA Script Writing | Goldsmiths, University of London\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3b6d208ce7b42a15\">>>",
      "url": "https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/ma-script-writing/",
      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e301add65ef61a86\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTo mark the end of your studies, you will take part in a graduate showcase - a celebration of scripts written on the MA Script Writing in front of industry experts. You will have the opportunity to present 10 minutes of a project, read and performed by professional actors. Alumni of this course go on to pursue sucessful careers in script writing. Read more about recent alumni successes and where this MA can take you. Study within Goldsmiths’ School of Media, Communications and Cultural Studies, and hone your craft in a critical, stimulating, and interdisciplinary creative environment.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e301add65ef61a86\">>>",
      "siteName": "www.gold.ac.uk"
    },
    {
      "title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"42fa9f3df8f4f0f1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMA Cultural Studies | Goldsmiths, University of London\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"42fa9f3df8f4f0f1\">>>",
      "url": "https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/ma-cultural-studies/",
      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"5bcc6964d6144d18\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThese span the fields of music, film, digital media, aesthetics, cultural industries, gender and queer studies, postcolonialism, journalism, political economy, critical race studies, and critical theory. Immerse yourself in a postgraduate environment shared by numerous creative practice-based MA programmes, such as MA Filmmaking, MA Journalism, and MA Script Writing.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"5bcc6964d6144d18\">>>",
      "siteName": "www.gold.ac.uk"
    },
    {
      "title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"16cc28d23fbdd44a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMA Critical & Creative Analysis | Goldsmiths, University of London\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"16cc28d23fbdd44a\">>>",
      "url": "https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/ma-critical-creative-analysis/",
      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"430731b7a7d81d74\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe MA Critical &amp; Creative Analysis at Goldsmiths, University of London introduces you to cultural studies, philosophy, postcolonial theory &amp; textual analysis.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"430731b7a7d81d74\">>>",
